    "text": "The correct match between column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> and&nbsp;column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math> is<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> (drug)</td>\t\t\t<td>Column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math> (test)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A) Chloroxylenol</td>\t\t\t<td>(P) Carbylamine test</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B) Norethindrone</td>\t\t\t<td>(Q) Sodium hydrogen carbonate test</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C) Sulphapyridine</td>\t\t\t<td>(R) Ferric chloride test</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D) Penicillin</td>\t\t\t<td>(S) Baeyer&rsquo;s test</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
